            {
                "entry_id": "c1fecead-0050-30c9-b5d1-fc391de6b674",
                "word": "gif",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "f725da4f-c3b1-4e91-af19-6fa1f6aef25c",
                        "entry_id": "c1fecead-0050-30c9-b5d1-fc391de6b674",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "gifs"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "84898bf0-fa6e-3fb2-87e1-55b87ea23ec1",
                        "entry_id": "c1fecead-0050-30c9-b5d1-fc391de6b674",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Image numérique au format GIF."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "familiar"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "80e3146a-9bbe-44f3-9db8-90dbeb638115",
                                "sense_id": "84898bf0-fa6e-3fb2-87e1-55b87ea23ec1",
                                "text": "Dans cet exercice, nous réaliserons une bannière animée composée de plusieurs images fixes, pour obtenir au final un gif animé. Il suffit de charger les images dans des calques différents et d’enregistrer l’image au format GIF."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a729fcd0-cf50-4aa2-b4df-dd07d75940ec",
                                "sense_id": "84898bf0-fa6e-3fb2-87e1-55b87ea23ec1",
                                "text": "Le futur c’est une infinité de liens vers des gifs de chatons mignons, des rediffusions de Docteur Who et des jeux d’argent en ligne."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a1110a19-f98e-43bb-9c01-df9a1046c728",
                                "sense_id": "84898bf0-fa6e-3fb2-87e1-55b87ea23ec1",
                                "text": "C’est peu dire que Dounia est différente des autres filles. Les autres : […] babillantes péronnelles étourdies par le son de leur propre voix, bouches en cul-de-poule et basses du front, la tête farcie d’émoticônes et de gifs animés, lolitas de quatre sous, perruches sans tête, méchantes comme des teignes et bêtes à lécher la route, enfin des adolescentes de quinze ans."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0593b9fc-78cb-4570-918f-3861959a6152",
                                "sense_id": "84898bf0-fa6e-3fb2-87e1-55b87ea23ec1",
                                "text": "Comme l’emoji, le gif peut servir de réaction à un message autant que de signal d’un double sens. Il a une fonction illustrative, mimant de façon caricaturale et hyperbolique nos attitudes et notre état d’esprit."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "859ec4be-6146-4a24-a116-89b3069dd012",
                        "source_entry_id": "c1fecead-0050-30c9-b5d1-fc391de6b674",
                        "source_sense_id": "84898bf0-fa6e-3fb2-87e1-55b87ea23ec1",
                        "source_sense_description": "Image numérique",
                        "target_lang_word": "GIF",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "GIF",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7ae8810f-b1b6-38a0-9d77-53bf91b82695",
                                        "entry_id": "8d0d3164-6c72-321e-900f-f2be148551a0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A bitmap image in a particular format with support for multiple images per file or animations, and up to 256 distinct colors per frame, including a fully transparent color."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e3a874da-6037-4e90-b5b6-a2f4b2a79f11",
                                                "sense_id": "7ae8810f-b1b6-38a0-9d77-53bf91b82695",
                                                "text": "I'll send you a GIF of the proposed logo."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0a382862-2aab-3b56-9e64-59b8fbc55060",
                                        "entry_id": "8d0d3164-6c72-321e-900f-f2be148551a0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any short video without audio, usually one which loops."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Internet",
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b0e54d92-c5c9-40d1-85e0-459aa5c85891",
                                                "sense_id": "0a382862-2aab-3b56-9e64-59b8fbc55060",
                                                "text": "Crying Dawson ruled the internet comment sections of the late ’00s and early ’10s. It’s “on the Mount Rushmore of GIFs,” says TV critic Sarah D. Bunting."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4292c973-4cac-3a88-8e4b-b7934735c6fb",
                                        "entry_id": "8d0d3164-6c72-321e-900f-f2be148551a0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any short video, in a format directly supported by HTML5 (ie. GIF, MP4, WebM)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Internet",
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "GIF",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cbacc540-7106-369c-b917-0a896dd9e39e",
                                        "entry_id": "a3cfa841-6c8b-3fe7-bdbe-2f7a4ce4776f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To create a GIF file of; (inexact) to create a similar animated image file of."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b8d25527-6fc5-4fd3-8f52-df8c9685e460",
                                                "sense_id": "cbacc540-7106-369c-b917-0a896dd9e39e",
                                                "text": "He GIFed the highlights of the debate"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "93637aad-65e2-40b1-8ea9-7892800e1a74",
                                                "sense_id": "cbacc540-7106-369c-b917-0a896dd9e39e",
                                                "text": "In fact, it seems this latest round of interest in the 2011 cover was sparked by the GIF-ing of Lawrence’s pre- and post-Photoshopped image, which made the rounds on Tumblr before seeping out to blogs like Crushable."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
